  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the global climate work and coordination of ICLEI- Local Governments for Sustainability. e.V. in its mandate to address sus-tainable urban development and the climate emergency, embracing the just transition as a central concept in climate action.</narrative>
